msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概觀"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:649
msgid "Here's an overview of the logical flow of a match statement:"
msgstr "以下是 match 陳述式邏輯流程的概觀："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:652
msgid ""
"The subject expression ``subject_expr`` is evaluated and a resulting subject "
"value obtained. If the subject expression contains a comma, a tuple is "
"constructed using :ref:`the standard rules <typesseq-tuple>`."
msgstr ""
"對主題運算式 ``subject_expr`` 求值，並取得產生的主題值。如果主題運算式包含逗"
"號，則會使用\\ :ref:`標準規則 <typesseq-tuple>`\\ 建構一個元組。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:656
msgid ""
"Each pattern in a ``case_block`` is attempted to match with the subject "
"value. The specific rules for success or failure are described below. The "
"match attempt can also bind some or all of the standalone names within the "
"pattern. The precise pattern binding rules vary per pattern type and are "
"specified below.  **Name bindings made during a successful pattern match "
"outlive the executed block and can be used after the match statement**."
msgstr ""
"``case_block`` 中的每個模式都會嘗試與主題值匹配。成功或失敗的具體規則描述如"
"下。匹配的嘗試也可能會繫結模式中部分或全部的獨立名稱。精確的模式繫結規則依模"
"式種類而有所不同，並說明如下。**在成功的模式匹配期間所做的名稱繫結，其存續時"
"間會超過所執行的區塊，並可以在 match 陳述式之後使用**。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:665
msgid ""
"During failed pattern matches, some subpatterns may succeed.  Do not rely on "
"bindings being made for a failed match.  Conversely, do not rely on "
"variables remaining unchanged after a failed match.  The exact behavior is "
"dependent on implementation and may vary.  This is an intentional decision "
"made to allow different implementations to add optimizations."
msgstr ""
"在失敗的模式匹配期間，部分子模式可能會成功。不要假設失敗的匹配會產生繫結。反"
"之，也不要依賴變數在失敗的匹配之後會保持不變。確切的行為取決於實作，並可能有"
"所不同。這是刻意的決定，目的是讓不同的實作能加入最佳化。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:672
msgid ""
"If the pattern succeeds, the corresponding guard (if present) is evaluated. "
"In this case all name bindings are guaranteed to have happened."
msgstr ""
"如果模式成功，則會對對應的防護 (guard)（如果有的話）求值。在這種情況下，所有"
"的名稱繫結都保證已經發生。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:675
msgid ""
"If the guard evaluates as true or is missing, the ``block`` inside "
"``case_block`` is executed."
msgstr "如果防護求值為真或不存在，則執行 ``case_block`` 內的 ``block``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:678
msgid "Otherwise, the next ``case_block`` is attempted as described above."
msgstr "否則，依上述方式嘗試下一個 ``case_block``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:680
msgid "If there are no further case blocks, the match statement is completed."
msgstr "如果沒有其他 case 區塊，則 match 陳述式完成。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:684
msgid ""
"Users should generally never rely on a pattern being evaluated.  Depending "
"on implementation, the interpreter may cache values or use other "
"optimizations which skip repeated evaluations."
msgstr ""
"使用者一般而言絕不應依賴模式會被求值。依實作而定，直譯器可能會快取值，或使用"
"其他會略過重複求值的最佳化。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:688
msgid "A sample match statement::"
msgstr "一個 match 陳述式範例： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:690
msgid ""
">>> flag = False\n"
">>> match (100, 200):\n"
"...    case (100, 300):  # Mismatch: 200 != 300\n"
"...        print('Case 1')\n"
"...    case (100, 200) if flag:  # Successful match, but guard fails\n"
"...        print('Case 2')\n"
"...    case (100, y):  # Matches and binds y to 200\n"
"...        print(f'Case 3, y: {y}')\n"
"...    case _:  # Pattern not attempted\n"
"...        print('Case 4, I match anything!')\n"
"...\n"
"Case 3, y: 200"
msgstr ""
">>> flag = False\n"
">>> match (100, 200):\n"
"...    case (100, 300):  # 不匹配：200 != 300\n"
"...        print('Case 1')\n"
"...    case (100, 200) if flag:  # 匹配成功，但防護失敗\n"
"...        print('Case 2')\n"
"...    case (100, y):  # 匹配並將 y 繫結為 200\n"
"...        print(f'Case 3, y: {y}')\n"
"...    case _:  # 不會嘗試此模式\n"
"...        print('Case 4, I match anything!')\n"
"...\n"
"Case 3, y: 200"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:704
msgid ""
"In this case, ``if flag`` is a guard.  Read more about that in the next "
"section."
msgstr "在此例中，``if flag`` 是一個防護。更多相關內容請見下一節。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:707
msgid "Guards"
msgstr "防護"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:714
msgid ""
"A ``guard`` (which is part of the ``case``) must succeed for code inside the "
"``case`` block to execute.  It takes the form: :keyword:`if` followed by an "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"``guard``\\ （它是 ``case`` 的一部分）必須成功，``case`` 區塊內的程式碼才會執"
"行。它的形式為：:keyword:`if` 後面接著一個運算式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:719
msgid "The logical flow of a ``case`` block with a ``guard`` follows:"
msgstr "帶有 ``guard`` 的 ``case`` 區塊，其邏輯流程如下："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:721
msgid ""
"Check that the pattern in the ``case`` block succeeded.  If the pattern "
"failed, the ``guard`` is not evaluated and the next ``case`` block is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"檢查 ``case`` 區塊中的模式是否成功。如果模式失敗，則不會對 ``guard`` 求值，並"
"檢查下一個 ``case`` 區塊。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:725
msgid "If the pattern succeeded, evaluate the ``guard``."
msgstr "如果模式成功，則對 ``guard`` 求值。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:727
msgid ""
"If the ``guard`` condition evaluates as true, the case block is selected."
msgstr "如果 ``guard`` 條件求值為真，則選擇該 case 區塊。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:730
msgid ""
"If the ``guard`` condition evaluates as false, the case block is not "
"selected."
msgstr "如果 ``guard`` 條件求值為假，則不選擇該 case 區塊。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:733
msgid ""
"If the ``guard`` raises an exception during evaluation, the exception "
"bubbles up."
msgstr "如果 ``guard`` 在求值期間引發例外，該例外會向上傳播。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:736
msgid ""
"Guards are allowed to have side effects as they are expressions.  Guard "
"evaluation must proceed from the first to the last case block, one at a "
"time, skipping case blocks whose pattern(s) don't all succeed. (I.e., guard "
"evaluation must happen in order.) Guard evaluation must stop once a case "
"block is selected."
msgstr ""
"由於防護是運算式，它們可以有副作用。防護的求值必須從第一個到最後一個 case 區"
"塊逐一進行，並略過模式未全部成功的 case 區塊。（也就是說，防護的求值必須依序"
"進行。）一旦選定某個 case 區塊，防護的求值就必須停止。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:746
msgid "Irrefutable Case Blocks"
msgstr "不可反駁的 case 區塊"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:750
msgid ""
"An irrefutable case block is a match-all case block.  A match statement may "
"have at most one irrefutable case block, and it must be last."
msgstr ""
"不可反駁的 case 區塊 (irrefutable case block) 是一個匹配所有情況的 case 區"
"塊。一個 match 陳述式最多只能有一個不可反駁的 case 區塊，而且它必須放在最後。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:753
msgid ""
"A case block is considered irrefutable if it has no guard and its pattern is "
"irrefutable.  A pattern is considered irrefutable if we can prove from its "
"syntax alone that it will always succeed.  Only the following patterns are "
"irrefutable:"
msgstr ""
"如果一個 case 區塊沒有防護，且其模式是不可反駁的，則該 case 區塊被視為不可反"
"駁的。如果僅從模式的語法就能證明它一定會成功，則該模式被視為不可反駁的。只有"
"以下模式是不可反駁的："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:758
msgid ":ref:`as-patterns` whose left-hand side is irrefutable"
msgstr "左側為不可反駁模式的 :ref:`as-patterns`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:760
msgid ":ref:`or-patterns` containing at least one irrefutable pattern"
msgstr "包含至少一個不可反駁模式的 :ref:`or-patterns`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:762
msgid ":ref:`capture-patterns`"
msgstr ":ref:`capture-patterns`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:764
msgid ":ref:`wildcard-patterns`"
msgstr ":ref:`wildcard-patterns`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:766
msgid "parenthesized irrefutable patterns"
msgstr "以圓括號括起來的不可反駁模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:770
msgid "Patterns"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:777
msgid "This section uses grammar notations beyond standard EBNF:"
msgstr "本節使用了標準 EBNF 以外的文法標記法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:779
msgid "the notation ``SEP.RULE+`` is shorthand for ``RULE (SEP RULE)*``"
msgstr "標記法 ``SEP.RULE+`` 是 ``RULE (SEP RULE)*`` 的簡寫"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:781
msgid "the notation ``!RULE`` is shorthand for a negative lookahead assertion"
msgstr "標記法 ``!RULE`` 是負向預查斷言 (negative lookahead assertion) 的簡寫"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:784
msgid "The top-level syntax for ``patterns`` is:"
msgstr "``patterns`` 的頂層語法為："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:798
msgid ""
"The descriptions below will include a description \"in simple terms\" of "
"what a pattern does for illustration purposes (credits to Raymond Hettinger "
"for a document that inspired most of the descriptions). Note that these "
"descriptions are purely for illustration purposes and **may not** reflect "
"the underlying implementation.  Furthermore, they do not cover all valid "
"forms."
msgstr ""
"以下的說明會包含一段「簡單來說」的描述，說明模式的作用以便於理解（感謝 "
"Raymond Hettinger 提供的一份文件，啟發了大部分的描述）。請注意，這些描述純粹"
"是為了說明用途，**不一定**\\ 反映底層的實作。此外，它們並未涵蓋所有有效的形"
"式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:808
msgid "OR Patterns"
msgstr "OR 模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:810
msgid ""
"An OR pattern is two or more patterns separated by vertical bars ``|``.  "
"Syntax:"
msgstr "OR 模式是以垂直線 ``|`` 分隔的兩個或多個模式。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:816
msgid ""
"Only the final subpattern may be :ref:`irrefutable <irrefutable_case>`, and "
"each subpattern must bind the same set of names to avoid ambiguity."
msgstr ""
"只有最後一個子模式可以是\\ :ref:`不可反駁的 <irrefutable_case>`，而且每個子模"
"式都必須繫結相同的名稱集合，以避免歧義。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:819
msgid ""
"An OR pattern matches each of its subpatterns in turn to the subject value, "
"until one succeeds.  The OR pattern is then considered successful.  "
"Otherwise, if none of the subpatterns succeed, the OR pattern fails."
msgstr ""
"OR 模式會依序將其每個子模式與主題值進行匹配，直到其中一個成功為止。此時 OR 模"
"式就被視為成功。否則，如果沒有任何子模式成功，則 OR 模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:823
msgid ""
"In simple terms, ``P1 | P2 | ...`` will try to match ``P1``, if it fails it "
"will try to match ``P2``, succeeding immediately if any succeeds, failing "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``P1 | P2 | ...`` 會嘗試匹配 ``P1``，如果失敗則嘗試匹配 ``P2``，只"
"要任何一個成功就立即成功，否則失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:829
msgid "AS Patterns"
msgstr "AS 模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:831
msgid ""
"An AS pattern matches an OR pattern on the left of the :keyword:`as` keyword "
"against a subject.  Syntax:"
msgstr "AS 模式會將 :keyword:`as` 關鍵字左側的 OR 模式與主題進行匹配。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:837
msgid ""
"If the OR pattern fails, the AS pattern fails.  Otherwise, the AS pattern "
"binds the subject to the name on the right of the as keyword and succeeds. "
"``capture_pattern`` cannot be a ``_``."
msgstr ""
"如果 OR 模式失敗，則 AS 模式失敗。否則，AS 模式會將主題繫結到 as 關鍵字右側的"
"名稱並成功。``capture_pattern`` 不能是 ``_``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:841
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``P as NAME`` will match with ``P``, and on success it will "
"set ``NAME = <subject>``."
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``P as NAME`` 會與 ``P`` 匹配，並在成功時設定 ``NAME = "
"<subject>``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:848
msgid "Literal Patterns"
msgstr "字面值模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:850
msgid ""
"A literal pattern corresponds to most :ref:`literals <literals>` in Python.  "
"Syntax:"
msgstr "字面值模式對應到 Python 中大多數的\\ :ref:`字面值 <literals>`。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:863
msgid ""
"The rule ``strings`` and the token ``NUMBER`` are defined in "
"the :doc:`standard Python grammar <./grammar>`.  Triple-quoted strings are "
"supported.  Raw strings and byte strings are supported.  :ref:`f-strings` "
"and :ref:`t-strings` are not supported."
msgstr ""
"規則 ``strings`` 和 token ``NUMBER`` 定義於\\ :doc:`標準 Python 文法 <./"
"grammar>`\\ 中。支援三引號字串。支援原始字串和位元組字串。不支援 :ref:`f-"
"strings`\\ 和 :ref:`t-strings`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:868
msgid ""
"The forms ``signed_number '+' NUMBER`` and ``signed_number '-' NUMBER`` are "
"for expressing :ref:`complex numbers <imaginary>`; they require a real "
"number on the left and an imaginary number on the right. E.g. ``3 + 4j``."
msgstr ""
"``signed_number '+' NUMBER`` 和 ``signed_number '-' NUMBER`` 形式用於表示"
"\\ :ref:`複數 <imaginary>`；它們要求左側為實數、右側為虛數。例如 ``3 + 4j``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:872
msgid ""
"In simple terms, ``LITERAL`` will succeed only if ``<subject> == LITERAL``. "
"For the singletons ``None``, ``True`` and ``False``, the :keyword:`is` "
"operator is used."
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``LITERAL`` 只有在 ``<subject> == LITERAL`` 時才會成功。對於單例 "
"``None``、``True`` 和 ``False``，則會使用 :keyword:`is` 運算子。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:878
msgid "Capture Patterns"
msgstr "擷取模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:880
msgid "A capture pattern binds the subject value to a name. Syntax:"
msgstr "擷取模式 (capture pattern) 會將主題值繫結到一個名稱。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:886
msgid ""
"A single underscore ``_`` is not a capture pattern (this is what ``!'_'`` "
"expresses). It is instead treated as a :token:`~python-"
"grammar:wildcard_pattern`."
msgstr ""
"單一底線 ``_`` 不是擷取模式（這就是 ``!'_'`` 所表達的），而是會被視"
"為 :token:`~python-grammar:wildcard_pattern`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:890
msgid ""
"In a given pattern, a given name can only be bound once.  E.g. ``case x, "
"x: ...`` is invalid while ``case [x] | x: ...`` is allowed."
msgstr ""
"在同一個模式中，每個名稱只能被繫結一次。例如 ``case x, x: ...`` 是無效的，而 "
"``case [x] | x: ...`` 則是允許的。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:893
msgid ""
"Capture patterns always succeed.  The binding follows scoping rules "
"established by the assignment expression operator in :pep:`572`; the name "
"becomes a local variable in the closest containing function scope unless "
"there's an applicable :keyword:`global` or :keyword:`nonlocal` statement."
msgstr ""
"擷取模式一定會成功。其繫結遵循 :pep:`572` 中賦值運算式運算子所建立的作用域規"
"則；除非有適用的 :keyword:`global` 或 :keyword:`nonlocal` 陳述式，否則該名稱"
"會成為最近的外圍函式作用域中的區域變數。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:898
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``NAME`` will always succeed and it will set ``NAME = "
"<subject>``."
msgstr "簡單來說，``NAME`` 一定會成功，並且會設定 ``NAME = <subject>``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:903
msgid "Wildcard Patterns"
msgstr "萬用字元模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:905
msgid ""
"A wildcard pattern always succeeds (matches anything) and binds no name.  "
"Syntax:"
msgstr ""
"萬用字元模式 (wildcard pattern) 一定會成功（匹配任何東西），且不繫結任何名"
"稱。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:911
msgid ""
"``_`` is a :ref:`soft keyword <soft-keywords>` within any pattern, but only "
"within patterns.  It is an identifier, as usual, even within ``match`` "
"subject expressions, ``guard``\\ s, and ``case`` blocks."
msgstr ""
"``_`` 在任何模式中都是\\ :ref:`軟關鍵字 <soft-keywords>`，但僅限於模式中。即"
"使在 ``match`` 主題運算式、``guard`` 和 ``case`` 區塊中，它仍如往常一樣是個識"
"別字。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:915
msgid "In simple terms, ``_`` will always succeed."
msgstr "簡單來說，``_`` 一定會成功。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:920
msgid "Value Patterns"
msgstr "值模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:922
msgid "A value pattern represents a named value in Python. Syntax:"
msgstr "值模式代表 Python 中一個具名的值。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:930
msgid ""
"The dotted name in the pattern is looked up using standard Python :ref:`name "
"resolution rules <resolve_names>`.  The pattern succeeds if the value found "
"compares equal to the subject value (using the ``==`` equality operator)."
msgstr ""
"模式中的點分隔名稱 (dotted name) 會使用標準的 Python :ref:`名稱解析規則 "
"<resolve_names>`\\ 來查找。如果找到的值與主題值比較相等（使用 ``==`` 相等運算"
"子），則該模式成功。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:935
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``NAME1.NAME2`` will succeed only if ``<subject> == "
"NAME1.NAME2``"
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``NAME1.NAME2`` 只有在 ``<subject> == NAME1.NAME2`` 時才會成功"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:939
msgid ""
"If the same value occurs multiple times in the same match statement, the "
"interpreter may cache the first value found and reuse it rather than repeat "
"the same lookup.  This cache is strictly tied to a given execution of a "
"given match statement."
msgstr ""
"如果同一個值在同一個 match 陳述式中出現多次，直譯器可能會快取第一個找到的值並"
"重複使用，而不是重複相同的查找。此快取僅在特定 match 陳述式的某一次執行期間有"
"效。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:947
msgid "Group Patterns"
msgstr "群組模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:949
msgid ""
"A group pattern allows users to add parentheses around patterns to emphasize "
"the intended grouping.  Otherwise, it has no additional syntax. Syntax:"
msgstr ""
"群組模式讓使用者可以在模式周圍加上圓括號，以強調預期的分組。除此之外，它沒有"
"額外的語法。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:956
msgid "In simple terms ``(P)`` has the same effect as ``P``."
msgstr "簡單來說，``(P)`` 與 ``P`` 的效果相同。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:961
msgid "Sequence Patterns"
msgstr "序列模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:963
msgid ""
"A sequence pattern contains several subpatterns to be matched against "
"sequence elements. The syntax is similar to the unpacking of a list or tuple."
msgstr ""
"序列模式包含數個要與序列元素進行匹配的子模式。其語法類似於串列或元組的拆解 "
"(unpacking)。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:974
msgid ""
"There is no difference if parentheses  or square brackets are used for "
"sequence patterns (i.e. ``(...)`` vs ``[...]`` )."
msgstr "序列模式使用圓括號或方括號並無差別（即 ``(...)`` 與 ``[...]``）。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:978
msgid ""
"A single pattern enclosed in parentheses without a trailing comma (e.g. ``(3 "
"| 4)``) is a :ref:`group pattern <group-patterns>`. While a single pattern "
"enclosed in square brackets (e.g. ``[3 | 4]``) is still a sequence pattern."
msgstr ""
"以圓括號括起來且沒有尾隨逗號的單一模式（例如 ``(3 | 4)``）是一個\\ :ref:`群組"
"模式 <group-patterns>`。而以方括號括起來的單一模式（例如 ``[3 | 4]``）仍然是"
"序列模式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:983
msgid ""
"At most one star subpattern may be in a sequence pattern.  The star "
"subpattern may occur in any position. If no star subpattern is present, the "
"sequence pattern is a fixed-length sequence pattern; otherwise it is a "
"variable-length sequence pattern."
msgstr ""
"序列模式中最多只能有一個星號子模式。星號子模式可以出現在任何位置。如果沒有星"
"號子模式，則該序列模式是固定長度序列模式；否則它是可變長度序列模式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:988
msgid ""
"The following is the logical flow for matching a sequence pattern against a "
"subject value:"
msgstr "以下是將序列模式與主題值進行匹配的邏輯流程："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:991
msgid ""
"If the subject value is not a sequence [#]_, the sequence pattern fails."
msgstr "如果主題值不是序列\\ [#]_，則序列模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:994
msgid ""
"If the subject value is an instance of ``str``, ``bytes`` or ``bytearray`` "
"the sequence pattern fails."
msgstr ""
"如果主題值是 ``str``、``bytes`` 或 ``bytearray`` 的實例，則序列模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:997
msgid ""
"The subsequent steps depend on whether the sequence pattern is fixed or "
"variable-length."
msgstr "後續步驟取決於序列模式是固定長度還是可變長度。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1000
msgid "If the sequence pattern is fixed-length:"
msgstr "如果序列模式是固定長度的："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1002
msgid ""
"If the length of the subject sequence is not equal to the number of "
"subpatterns, the sequence pattern fails"
msgstr "如果主題序列的長度不等於子模式的數量，則序列模式失敗"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Subpatterns in the sequence pattern are matched to their corresponding items "
"in the subject sequence from left to right.  Matching stops as soon as a "
"subpattern fails.  If all subpatterns succeed in matching their "
"corresponding item, the sequence pattern succeeds."
msgstr ""
"序列模式中的子模式會由左至右與主題序列中對應的項目進行匹配。只要有一個子模式"
"失敗，匹配就會停止。如果所有子模式都成功匹配其對應的項目，則序列模式成功。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1010
msgid "Otherwise, if the sequence pattern is variable-length:"
msgstr "否則，如果序列模式是可變長度的："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1012
msgid ""
"If the length of the subject sequence is less than the number of non-star "
"subpatterns, the sequence pattern fails."
msgstr "如果主題序列的長度小於非星號子模式的數量，則序列模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1015
msgid ""
"The leading non-star subpatterns are matched to their corresponding items as "
"for fixed-length sequences."
msgstr "前面的非星號子模式會如同固定長度序列一樣，與其對應的項目進行匹配。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1018
msgid ""
"If the previous step succeeds, the star subpattern matches a list formed of "
"the remaining subject items, excluding the remaining items corresponding to "
"non-star subpatterns following the star subpattern."
msgstr ""
"如果上一步成功，星號子模式會匹配一個由剩餘主題項目所組成的串列，但不包括對應"
"到星號子模式之後那些非星號子模式的剩餘項目。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1022
msgid ""
"Remaining non-star subpatterns are matched to their corresponding subject "
"items, as for a fixed-length sequence."
msgstr "其餘的非星號子模式會如同固定長度序列一樣，與其對應的主題項目進行匹配。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1025
msgid ""
"The length of the subject sequence is obtained via :func:`len` (i.e. via "
"the :meth:`~object.__len__` protocol). This length may be cached by the "
"interpreter in a similar manner as :ref:`value patterns <value-patterns>`."
msgstr ""
"主題序列的長度是透過 :func:`len`\\ （即透過 :meth:`~object.__len__` 協定）取"
"得的。直譯器可能會以類似於\\ :ref:`值模式 <value-patterns>`\\ 的方式快取此長"
"度。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1031
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``[P1, P2, P3,`` ... ``, P<N>]`` matches only if all the "
"following happens:"
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``[P1, P2, P3,`` ... ``, P<N>]`` 只有在以下所有情況都發生時才會匹"
"配："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1034
msgid "check ``<subject>`` is a sequence"
msgstr "檢查 ``<subject>`` 是一個序列"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1035
msgid "``len(subject) == <N>``"
msgstr "``len(subject) == <N>``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1036
msgid ""
"``P1`` matches ``<subject>[0]`` (note that this match can also bind names)"
msgstr "``P1`` 匹配 ``<subject>[0]``\\ （請注意，此匹配也可以繫結名稱）"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1037
msgid ""
"``P2`` matches ``<subject>[1]`` (note that this match can also bind names)"
msgstr "``P2`` 匹配 ``<subject>[1]``\\ （請注意，此匹配也可以繫結名稱）"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1038
msgid "... and so on for the corresponding pattern/element."
msgstr "... 依此類推，套用到對應的模式/元素。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1043
msgid "Mapping Patterns"
msgstr "對映模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1045
msgid ""
"A mapping pattern contains one or more key-value patterns.  The syntax is "
"similar to the construction of a dictionary. Syntax:"
msgstr "對映模式包含一個或多個鍵值模式。其語法類似於字典的建構。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1056
msgid ""
"At most one double star pattern may be in a mapping pattern.  The double "
"star pattern must be the last subpattern in the mapping pattern."
msgstr ""
"對映模式中最多只能有一個雙星號模式。雙星號模式必須是對映模式中的最後一個子模"
"式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1059
msgid ""
"Duplicate keys in mapping patterns are disallowed. Duplicate literal keys "
"will raise a :exc:`SyntaxError`. Two keys that otherwise have the same value "
"will raise a :exc:`ValueError` at runtime."
msgstr ""
"對映模式中不允許重複的鍵。重複的字面值鍵會引發 :exc:`SyntaxError`。以其他方式"
"得出相同值的兩個鍵則會在 runtime 引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1063
msgid ""
"The following is the logical flow for matching a mapping pattern against a "
"subject value:"
msgstr "以下是將對映模式與主題值進行匹配的邏輯流程："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1066
msgid "If the subject value is not a mapping [#]_,the mapping pattern fails."
msgstr "如果主題值不是對映\\ [#]_，則對映模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1068
msgid ""
"If every key given in the mapping pattern is present in the subject mapping, "
"and the pattern for each key matches the corresponding item of the subject "
"mapping, the mapping pattern succeeds."
msgstr ""
"如果對映模式中給定的每個鍵都存在於主題對映中，且每個鍵的模式都與主題對映中對"
"應的項目匹配，則對映模式成功。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1072
msgid ""
"If duplicate keys are detected in the mapping pattern, the pattern is "
"considered invalid. A :exc:`SyntaxError` is raised for duplicate literal "
"values; or a :exc:`ValueError` for named keys of the same value."
msgstr ""
"如果在對映模式中偵測到重複的鍵，則該模式被視為無效。重複的字面值會引"
"發 :exc:`SyntaxError`；具有相同值的具名鍵則會引發 :exc:`ValueError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1076
msgid ""
"Key-value pairs are matched using the two-argument form of the mapping "
"subject's ``get()`` method.  Matched key-value pairs must already be present "
"in the mapping, and not created on-the-fly via :meth:`~object.__missing__` "
"or :meth:`~object.__getitem__`."
msgstr ""
"鍵值對是使用對映主題之 ``get()`` 方法的雙引數形式來匹配的。匹配的鍵值對必須已"
"經存在於對映中，而不是透過 :meth:`~object.__missing__` "
"或 :meth:`~object.__getitem__` 即時建立的。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1081
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``{KEY1: P1, KEY2: P2, ... }`` matches only if all the "
"following happens:"
msgstr ""
"簡單來說，``{KEY1: P1, KEY2: P2, ... }`` 只有在以下所有情況都發生時才會匹配："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1084
msgid "check ``<subject>`` is a mapping"
msgstr "檢查 ``<subject>`` 是一個對映"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1085
msgid "``KEY1 in <subject>``"
msgstr "``KEY1 in <subject>``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1086
msgid "``P1`` matches ``<subject>[KEY1]``"
msgstr "``P1`` 匹配 ``<subject>[KEY1]``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1087
msgid "... and so on for the corresponding KEY/pattern pair."
msgstr "... 依此類推，套用到對應的 KEY/模式對。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1093
msgid "Class Patterns"
msgstr "類別模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1095
msgid ""
"A class pattern represents a class and its positional and keyword arguments "
"(if any).  Syntax:"
msgstr "類別模式代表一個類別及其位置引數和關鍵字引數（如果有的話）。語法："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1106
msgid "The same keyword should not be repeated in class patterns."
msgstr "在類別模式中不應重複相同的關鍵字。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1108
msgid ""
"The following is the logical flow for matching a class pattern against a "
"subject value:"
msgstr "以下是將類別模式與主題值進行匹配的邏輯流程："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1111
msgid ""
"If ``name_or_attr`` is not an instance of the builtin :class:`type` , "
"raise :exc:`TypeError`."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``name_or_attr`` 不是內建 :class:`type` 的實例，則引"
"發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1114
msgid ""
"If the subject value is not an instance of ``name_or_attr`` (tested "
"via :func:`isinstance`), the class pattern fails."
msgstr ""
"如果主題值不是 ``name_or_attr`` 的實例（透過 :func:`isinstance` 測試），則類"
"別模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1117
msgid ""
"If no pattern arguments are present, the pattern succeeds.  Otherwise, the "
"subsequent steps depend on whether keyword or positional argument patterns "
"are present."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有模式引數，則模式成功。否則，後續步驟取決於是否有關鍵字或位置引數模"
"式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1121
msgid ""
"For a number of built-in types (specified below), a single positional "
"subpattern is accepted which will match the entire subject; for these types "
"keyword patterns also work as for other types."
msgstr ""
"對於部分內建型別（如下所列），會接受單一位置子模式，並與整個主題匹配；對於這"
"些型別，關鍵字模式的運作方式也與其他型別相同。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1125
msgid ""
"If only keyword patterns are present, they are processed as follows, one by "
"one:"
msgstr "如果只有關鍵字模式，則會逐一以下列方式處理："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1128
msgid "The keyword is looked up as an attribute on the subject."
msgstr "將關鍵字作為主題的屬性來查找。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1130
msgid ""
"If this raises an exception other than :exc:`AttributeError`, the exception "
"bubbles up."
msgstr "如果這引發 :exc:`AttributeError` 以外的例外，則該例外會向上傳播。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1133
msgid "If this raises :exc:`AttributeError`, the class pattern has failed."
msgstr "如果這引發 :exc:`AttributeError`，則類別模式失敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1135
msgid ""
"Else, the subpattern associated with the keyword pattern is matched against "
"the subject's attribute value.  If this fails, the class pattern fails; if "
"this succeeds, the match proceeds to the next keyword."
msgstr ""
"否則，與該關鍵字模式關聯的子模式會與主題的屬性值進行匹配。如果失敗，則類別模"
"式失敗；如果成功，則匹配會繼續處理下一個關鍵字。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1140
msgid "If all keyword patterns succeed, the class pattern succeeds."
msgstr "如果所有關鍵字模式都成功，則類別模式成功。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1142
msgid ""
"If any positional patterns are present, they are converted to keyword "
"patterns using the :data:`~object.__match_args__` attribute on the class "
"``name_or_attr`` before matching:"
msgstr ""
"如果有任何位置模式，則在匹配之前，會使用類別 ``name_or_attr`` 上"
"的 :data:`~object.__match_args__` 屬性將它們轉換為關鍵字模式："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1146
msgid "The equivalent of ``getattr(cls, \"__match_args__\", ())`` is called."
msgstr "呼叫等同於 ``getattr(cls, \"__match_args__\", ())`` 的操作。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1148
msgid "If this raises an exception, the exception bubbles up."
msgstr "如果這引發例外，則該例外會向上傳播。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1150
msgid ""
"If the returned value is not a tuple, the conversion fails "
"and :exc:`TypeError` is raised."
msgstr "如果回傳的值不是元組，則轉換失敗並引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1153
msgid ""
"If there are more positional patterns than "
"``len(cls.__match_args__)``, :exc:`TypeError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"如果位置模式的數量多於 ``len(cls.__match_args__)``，則引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1156
msgid ""
"Otherwise, positional pattern ``i`` is converted to a keyword pattern using "
"``__match_args__[i]`` as the keyword.  ``__match_args__[i]`` must be a "
"string; if not :exc:`TypeError` is raised."
msgstr ""
"否則，位置模式 ``i`` 會以 ``__match_args__[i]`` 作為關鍵字，轉換為關鍵字模"
"式。``__match_args__[i]`` 必須是字串；否則會引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1160
msgid "If there are duplicate keywords, :exc:`TypeError` is raised."
msgstr "如果有重複的關鍵字，則引發 :exc:`TypeError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1162
msgid ":ref:`class-pattern-matching`"
msgstr ":ref:`class-pattern-matching`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1164
msgid ""
"Once all positional patterns have been converted to keyword patterns, the "
"match proceeds as if there were only keyword patterns."
msgstr ""
"一旦所有位置模式都已轉換為關鍵字模式，匹配就會如同只有關鍵字模式一樣繼續進"
"行。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1167
msgid ""
"For the following built-in types the handling of positional subpatterns is "
"different:"
msgstr "對於以下內建型別，位置子模式的處理方式有所不同："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1170
msgid ":class:`bool`"
msgstr ":class:`bool`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1171
msgid ":class:`bytearray`"
msgstr ":class:`bytearray`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1172
msgid ":class:`bytes`"
msgstr ":class:`bytes`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1173
msgid ":class:`dict`"
msgstr ":class:`dict`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1174
msgid ":class:`float`"
msgstr ":class:`float`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1175
msgid ":class:`frozendict`"
msgstr ":class:`frozendict`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1176
msgid ":class:`frozenset`"
msgstr ":class:`frozenset`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1177
msgid ":class:`int`"
msgstr ":class:`int`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1178
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2053
msgid ":class:`list`"
msgstr ":class:`list`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1179
msgid ":class:`set`"
msgstr ":class:`set`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1180
msgid ":class:`str`"
msgstr ":class:`str`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1181
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2056
msgid ":class:`tuple`"
msgstr ":class:`tuple`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1183
msgid ""
"These classes accept a single positional argument, and the pattern there is "
"matched against the whole object rather than an attribute. For example "
"``int(0|1)`` matches the value ``0``, but not the value ``0.0``."
msgstr ""
"這些類別接受單一位置引數，且其中的模式會與整個物件匹配，而不是與某個屬性匹"
"配。例如 ``int(0|1)`` 會匹配值 ``0``，但不會匹配值 ``0.0``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1187
msgid ""
"In simple terms ``CLS(P1, attr=P2)`` matches only if the following happens:"
msgstr "簡單來說，``CLS(P1, attr=P2)`` 只有在以下情況發生時才會匹配："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1189
msgid "``isinstance(<subject>, CLS)``"
msgstr "``isinstance(<subject>, CLS)``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1190
msgid "convert ``P1`` to a keyword pattern using ``CLS.__match_args__``"
msgstr "使用 ``CLS.__match_args__`` 將 ``P1`` 轉換為關鍵字模式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1191
msgid "For each keyword argument ``attr=P2``:"
msgstr "對於每個關鍵字引數 ``attr=P2``："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1193
msgid "``hasattr(<subject>, \"attr\")``"
msgstr "``hasattr(<subject>, \"attr\")``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1194
msgid "``P2`` matches ``<subject>.attr``"
msgstr "``P2`` 匹配 ``<subject>.attr``"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1196
msgid "... and so on for the corresponding keyword argument/pattern pair."
msgstr "... 依此類推，套用到對應的關鍵字引數/模式對。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1211
msgid "Function definitions"
msgstr "函式定義"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1226
msgid ""
"A function definition defines a user-defined function object (see "
"section :ref:`types`):"
msgstr ""
"函式定義會定義一個使用者定義的函式物件（請參閱\\ :ref:`types`\\ 章節）："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1248
msgid ""
"A function definition is an executable statement.  Its execution binds the "
"function name in the current local namespace to a function object (a wrapper "
"around the executable code for the function).  This function object contains "
"a reference to the current global namespace as the global namespace to be "
"used when the function is called."
msgstr ""
"函式定義是一個可執行的陳述式。它的執行會將目前區域命名空間中的函式名稱繫結到"
"一個函式物件（即函式可執行程式碼的包裝器）。此函式物件包含對目前全域命名空間"
"的參照，作為呼叫該函式時所使用的全域命名空間。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1254
msgid ""
"The function definition does not execute the function body; this gets "
"executed only when the function is called. [#]_"
msgstr "函式定義不會執行函式主體；函式主體只有在函式被呼叫時才會執行。[#]_"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1260
msgid ""
"A function definition may be wrapped by one or more :term:`decorator` "
"expressions. Decorator expressions are evaluated when the function is "
"defined, in the scope that contains the function definition.  The result "
"must be a callable, which is invoked with the function object as the only "
"argument. The returned value is bound to the function name instead of the "
"function object.  Multiple decorators are applied in nested fashion. For "
"example, the following code ::"
msgstr ""
"函式定義可以被一個或多個\\ :term:`裝飾器 <decorator>`\\ 運算式包裝。裝飾器運"
"算式會在函式被定義時，於包含該函式定義的作用域中求值。其結果必須是一個可呼叫"
"物件，並以該函式物件作為唯一的引數來呼叫它。繫結到函式名稱的是回傳的值，而非"
"函式物件本身。多個裝飾器會以巢狀方式套用。例如以下程式碼 ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1267
msgid ""
"@f1(arg)\n"
"@f2\n"
"def func(): pass"
msgstr ""
"@f1(arg)\n"
"@f2\n"
"def func(): pass"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1271
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1463
msgid "is roughly equivalent to ::"
msgstr "大致等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1273
msgid ""
"def func(): pass\n"
"func = f1(arg)(f2(func))"
msgstr ""
"def func(): pass\n"
"func = f1(arg)(f2(func))"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1276
msgid ""
"except that the original function is not temporarily bound to the name "
"``func``."
msgstr "差別在於原本的函式不會被暫時繫結到名稱 ``func``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1278
msgid ""
"Functions may be decorated with any valid :token:`~python-"
"grammar:assignment_expression`. Previously, the grammar was much more "
"restrictive; see :pep:`614` for details."
msgstr ""
"函式可以使用任何有效的 :token:`~python-grammar:assignment_expression` 來裝"
"飾。先前的文法限制嚴格得多；詳情請參閱 :pep:`614`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1283
msgid ""
"A list of :ref:`type parameters <type-params>` may be given in square "
"brackets between the function's name and the opening parenthesis for its "
"parameter list. This indicates to static type checkers that the function is "
"generic. At runtime, the type parameters can be retrieved from the "
"function's :attr:`~function.__type_params__` attribute. See :ref:`generic-"
"functions` for more."
msgstr ""
"可以在函式名稱和其參數列表的左圓括號之間，以方括號給定一個\\ :ref:`型別參數 "
"<type-params>`\\ 列表。這會向靜態型別檢查器表示該函式是泛型的。在 runtime，可"
"以從函式的 :attr:`~function.__type_params__` 屬性取得型別參數。更多資訊請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`generic-functions`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1290
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1482
msgid "Type parameter lists are new in Python 3.12."
msgstr "型別參數列表是 Python 3.12 新增的功能。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1298
msgid ""
"When one or more :term:`parameters <parameter>` have the form *parameter* "
"``=`` *expression*, the function is said to have \"default parameter values."
"\"  For a parameter with a default value, the corresponding :term:`argument` "
"may be omitted from a call, in which case the parameter's default value is "
"substituted.  If a parameter has a default value, all following parameters "
"up until the \"``*``\" must also have a default value --- this is a "
"syntactic restriction that is not expressed by the grammar."
msgstr ""
"當一個或多個\\ :term:`參數 <parameter>`\\ 具有 *parameter* ``=`` "
"*expression* 的形式時，該函式被稱為具有「預設參數值」。對於具有預設值的參數，"
"呼叫時可以省略對應的\\ :term:`引數 <argument>`，此時會以該參數的預設值代替。"
"如果一個參數具有預設值，則其後直到「``*``」為止的所有參數也都必須具有預設值 "
"--- 這是一個未在文法中表達的語法限制。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1306
msgid ""
"**Default parameter values are evaluated from left to right when the "
"function definition is executed.** This means that the expression is "
"evaluated once, when the function is defined, and that the same \"pre-"
"computed\" value is used for each call.  This is especially important to "
"understand when a default parameter value is a mutable object, such as a "
"list or a dictionary: if the function modifies the object (e.g. by appending "
"an item to a list), the default parameter value is in effect modified.  This "
"is generally not what was intended.  A way around this is to use ``None`` as "
"the default, and explicitly test for it in the body of the function, for "
"example::"
msgstr ""
"**預設參數值會在執行函式定義時由左至右求值。**\\ 這表示該運算式只會在函式被定"
"義時求值一次，且每次呼叫都會使用相同的「預先計算」值。當預設參數值是可變物件"
"（例如串列或字典）時，理解這一點尤其重要：如果函式修改了該物件（例如將項目附"
"加到串列中），實際上預設參數值就被修改了。這通常不是原本預期的行為。解決方法"
"是使用 ``None`` 作為預設值，並在函式主體中明確地檢查它，例如： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1316
msgid ""
"def whats_on_the_telly(penguin=None):\n"
"    if penguin is None:\n"
"        penguin = []\n"
"    penguin.append(\"property of the zoo\")\n"
"    return penguin"
msgstr ""
"def whats_on_the_telly(penguin=None):\n"
"    if penguin is None:\n"
"        penguin = []\n"
"    penguin.append(\"property of the zoo\")\n"
"    return penguin"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1327
msgid ""
"Function call semantics are described in more detail in "
"section :ref:`calls`. A function call always assigns values to all "
"parameters mentioned in the parameter list, either from positional "
"arguments, from keyword arguments, or from default values.  If the form "
"\"``*identifier``\" is present, it is initialized to a tuple receiving any "
"excess positional parameters, defaulting to the empty tuple. If the form "
"\"``**identifier``\" is present, it is initialized to a new ordered mapping "
"receiving any excess keyword arguments, defaulting to a new empty mapping of "
"the same type.  Parameters after \"``*``\" or \"``*identifier``\" are "
"keyword-only parameters and may only be passed by keyword arguments.  "
"Parameters before \"``/``\" are positional-only parameters and may only be "
"passed by positional arguments."
msgstr ""
"函式呼叫的語義在 :ref:`calls` 章節中有更詳細的說明。函式呼叫一律會為參數列表"
"中提及的所有參數賦值，這些值可能來自位置引數、關鍵字引數或預設值。如果存在"
"「``*identifier``」形式，它會被初始化為一個接收任何多餘位置參數的元組，預設為"
"空元組。如果存在「``**identifier``」形式，它會被初始化為一個新的有序對映，接"
"收任何多餘的關鍵字引數，預設為一個相同型別的新空對映。在「``*``」或"
"「``*identifier``」之後的參數是僅限關鍵字參數，只能透過關鍵字引數傳遞。在"
"「``/``」之前的參數是僅限位置參數，只能透過位置引數傳遞。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1339
msgid ""
"The ``/`` function parameter syntax may be used to indicate positional-only "
"parameters. See :pep:`570` for details."
msgstr "``/`` 函式參數語法可用於表示僅限位置參數。詳情請參閱 :pep:`570`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1348
msgid ""
"Parameters may have an :term:`annotation <function annotation>` of the form "
"\"``: expression``\" following the parameter name.  Any parameter may have "
"an annotation, even those of the form ``*identifier`` or ``**identifier``. "
"(As a special case, parameters of the form ``*identifier`` may have an "
"annotation \"``: *expression``\".) Functions may have \"return\" annotation "
"of the form \"``-> expression``\" after the parameter list.  These "
"annotations can be any valid Python expression.  The presence of annotations "
"does not change the semantics of a function. See :ref:`annotations` for more "
"information on annotations."
msgstr ""
"參數可以在參數名稱之後帶有「``: expression``」形式的\\ :term:`註釋 <function "
"annotation>`。任何參數都可以有註釋，即使是 ``*identifier`` 或 "
"``**identifier`` 形式的參數也一樣。（作為特例，``*identifier`` 形式的參數可以"
"有「``: *expression``」註釋。）函式可以在參數列表之後帶有「``-> "
"expression``」形式的「回傳」註釋。這些註釋可以是任何有效的 Python 運算式。註"
"釋的存在不會改變函式的語義。關於註釋的更多資訊，請參閱\\ :ref:`annotations`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1356
msgid ""
"Parameters of the form \"``*identifier``\" may have an annotation \"``: "
"*expression``\". See :pep:`646`."
msgstr ""
"「``*identifier``」形式的參數可以有「``: *expression``」註釋。請參"
"閱 :pep:`646`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1362
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create anonymous functions (functions not bound to a "
"name), for immediate use in expressions.  This uses lambda expressions, "
"described in section :ref:`lambda`.  Note that the lambda expression is "
"merely a shorthand for a simplified function definition; a function defined "
"in a \":keyword:`def`\" statement can be passed around or assigned to "
"another name just like a function defined by a lambda expression.  The "
"\":keyword:`!def`\" form is actually more powerful since it allows the "
"execution of multiple statements and annotations."
msgstr ""
"也可以建立匿名函式（未繫結到名稱的函式），以便在運算式中立即使用。這會用到 "
"lambda 運算式，如 :ref:`lambda` 章節所述。請注意，lambda 運算式只是簡化函式定"
"義的簡寫；在「:keyword:`def`」陳述式中定義的函式，就和以 lambda 運算式定義的"
"函式一樣，可以被傳遞或賦值給另一個名稱。「:keyword:`!def`」形式實際上更強大，"
"因為它允許執行多個陳述式，也允許使用註釋。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1370
msgid ""
"**Programmer's note:** Functions are first-class objects.  A \"``def``\" "
"statement executed inside a function definition defines a local function "
"that can be returned or passed around.  Free variables used in the nested "
"function can access the local variables of the function containing the def.  "
"See section :ref:`naming` for details."
msgstr ""
"**程式設計師備註：**\\ 函式是一級物件 (first-class object)。在函式定義內執行"
"的「``def``」陳述式會定義一個可以被回傳或傳遞的區域函式。巢狀函式中使用的自由"
"變數可以存取包含該 def 之函式的區域變數。詳情請參閱 :ref:`naming` 章節。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1378
msgid ":pep:`3107` - Function Annotations"
msgstr ":pep:`3107` - 函式註釋"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1379
msgid "The original specification for function annotations."
msgstr "函式註釋的原始規格。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1381
msgid ":pep:`484` - Type Hints"
msgstr ":pep:`484` - 型別提示"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1382
msgid "Definition of a standard meaning for annotations: type hints."
msgstr "定義註釋的標準意義：型別提示。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1384
msgid ":pep:`526` - Syntax for Variable Annotations"
msgstr ":pep:`526` - 變數註釋的語法"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1385
msgid ""
"Ability to type hint variable declarations, including class variables and "
"instance variables."
msgstr "能夠為變數宣告加上型別提示，包括類別變數和實例變數。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1388
msgid ":pep:`563` - Postponed Evaluation of Annotations"
msgstr ":pep:`563` - 註釋的延後求值"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1389
msgid ""
"Support for forward references within annotations by preserving annotations "
"in a string form at runtime instead of eager evaluation."
msgstr ""
"透過在 runtime 以字串形式保存註釋而非立即求值，來支援註釋中的前向參照。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1392
msgid ":pep:`318` - Decorators for Functions and Methods"
msgstr ":pep:`318` - 函式和方法的裝飾器"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1393
msgid ""
"Function and method decorators were introduced. Class decorators were "
"introduced in :pep:`3129`."
msgstr "引進了函式和方法裝飾器。類別裝飾器則是在 :pep:`3129` 中引進的。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1399
msgid "Class definitions"
msgstr "類別定義"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1414
msgid "A class definition defines a class object (see section :ref:`types`):"
msgstr "類別定義會定義一個類別物件（請參閱\\ :ref:`types`\\ 章節）："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1421
msgid ""
"A class definition is an executable statement.  The inheritance list usually "
"gives a list of base classes (see :ref:`metaclasses` for more advanced "
"uses), so each item in the list should evaluate to a class object which "
"allows subclassing.  Classes without an inheritance list inherit, by "
"default, from the base class :class:`object`; hence, ::"
msgstr ""
"類別定義是一個可執行的陳述式。繼承列表通常會給定一個基底類別的串列（更進階的"
"用法請參閱 :ref:`metaclasses`），因此串列中的每個項目都應該求值為一個允許子類"
"別化的類別物件。沒有繼承列表的類別預設會繼承自基底類別 :class:`object`；因"
"此， ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1427
msgid ""
"class Foo:\n"
"    pass"
msgstr ""
"class Foo:\n"
"    pass"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1430
msgid "is equivalent to ::"
msgstr "等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1432
msgid ""
"class Foo(object):\n"
"    pass"
msgstr ""
"class Foo(object):\n"
"    pass"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1435
msgid ""
"There may be one or more base classes; see :ref:`multiple-inheritance` below "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"可以有一個或多個基底類別；更多資訊請參閱下方的\\ :ref:`multiple-"
"inheritance`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1438
msgid ""
"The class's suite is then executed in a new execution frame "
"(see :ref:`naming`), using a newly created local namespace and the original "
"global namespace. (Usually, the suite contains mostly function "
"definitions.)  When the class's suite finishes execution, its execution "
"frame is discarded but its local namespace is saved. [#]_ A class object is "
"then created using the inheritance list for the base classes and the saved "
"local namespace for the attribute dictionary.  The class name is bound to "
"this class object in the original local namespace."
msgstr ""
"接著，類別的套組會在一個新的執行框 (execution frame) 中執行（請參"
"閱 :ref:`naming`），使用新建立的區域命名空間和原本的全域命名空間。（通常，套"
"組主要包含函式定義。）當類別的套組執行完畢時，其執行框會被丟棄，但其區域命名"
"空間會被保存。[#]_\\ 接著會以繼承列表作為基底類別、以保存的區域命名空間作為屬"
"性字典，來建立類別物件。類別名稱會在原本的區域命名空間中被繫結到此類別物件。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1447
msgid ""
"The order in which attributes are defined in the class body is preserved in "
"the new class's :attr:`~type.__dict__`.  Note that this is reliable only "
"right after the class is created and only for classes that were defined "
"using the definition syntax."
msgstr ""
"在類別主體中定義屬性的順序，會保留在新類別的 :attr:`~type.__dict__` 中。請注"
"意，這僅在類別剛建立之後才可靠，且僅適用於使用定義語法所定義的類別。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1452
msgid ""
"Class creation can be customized heavily using :ref:`metaclasses "
"<metaclasses>`."
msgstr "可以使用\\ :ref:`元類別 <metaclasses>`\\ 大幅自訂類別的建立。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1457
msgid "Classes can also be decorated: just like when decorating functions, ::"
msgstr "類別也可以被裝飾：就像裝飾函式時一樣， ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1459
msgid ""
"@f1(arg)\n"
"@f2\n"
"class Foo: pass"
msgstr ""
"@f1(arg)\n"
"@f2\n"
"class Foo: pass"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1465
msgid ""
"class Foo: pass\n"
"Foo = f1(arg)(f2(Foo))"
msgstr ""
"class Foo: pass\n"
"Foo = f1(arg)(f2(Foo))"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1468
msgid ""
"The evaluation rules for the decorator expressions are the same as for "
"function decorators.  The result is then bound to the class name."
msgstr ""
"裝飾器運算式的求值規則與函式裝飾器相同。接著，其結果會被繫結到類別名稱。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1471
msgid ""
"Classes may be decorated with any valid :token:`~python-"
"grammar:assignment_expression`. Previously, the grammar was much more "
"restrictive; see :pep:`614` for details."
msgstr ""
"類別可以使用任何有效的 :token:`~python-grammar:assignment_expression` 來裝"
"飾。先前的文法限制嚴格得多；詳情請參閱 :pep:`614`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1476
msgid ""
"A list of :ref:`type parameters <type-params>` may be given in square "
"brackets immediately after the class's name. This indicates to static type "
"checkers that the class is generic. At runtime, the type parameters can be "
"retrieved from the class's :attr:`~type.__type_params__` attribute. "
"See :ref:`generic-classes` for more."
msgstr ""
"可以在類別名稱之後緊接著以方括號給定一個\\ :ref:`型別參數 <type-params>`\\ 列"
"表。這會向靜態型別檢查器表示該類別是泛型的。在 runtime，可以從類別"
"的 :attr:`~type.__type_params__` 屬性取得型別參數。更多資訊請參閱"
"\\ :ref:`generic-classes`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1485
msgid ""
"**Programmer's note:** Variables defined in the class definition are class "
"attributes; they are shared by instances.  Instance attributes can be set in "
"a method with ``self.name = value``.  Both class and instance attributes are "
"accessible through the notation \"``self.name``\", and an instance attribute "
"hides a class attribute with the same name when accessed in this way.  Class "
"attributes can be used as defaults for instance attributes, but using "
"mutable values there can lead to unexpected results.  :ref:`Descriptors "
"<descriptors>` can be used to create instance variables with different "
"implementation details."
msgstr ""
"**程式設計師備註：**\\ 在類別定義中定義的變數是類別屬性；它們由所有實例共享。"
"實例屬性可以在方法中以 ``self.name = value`` 設定。類別屬性和實例屬性都可以透"
"過「``self.name``」標記法存取，而以這種方式存取時，實例屬性會遮蔽同名的類別屬"
"性。類別屬性可以作為實例屬性的預設值，但在此使用可變的值可能會導致意外的結"
"果。:ref:`描述器 <descriptors>`\\ 可以用來建立具有不同實作細節的實例變數。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1497
msgid ":pep:`3115` - Metaclasses in Python 3000"
msgstr ":pep:`3115` - Python 3000 中的元類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1498
msgid ""
"The proposal that changed the declaration of metaclasses to the current "
"syntax, and the semantics for how classes with metaclasses are constructed."
msgstr ""
"此提案將元類別的宣告方式改為目前的語法，並更改了具有元類別之類別的建構語義。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1502
msgid ":pep:`3129` - Class Decorators"
msgstr ":pep:`3129` - 類別裝飾器"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1503
msgid ""
"The proposal that added class decorators.  Function and method decorators "
"were introduced in :pep:`318`."
msgstr "新增類別裝飾器的提案。函式和方法裝飾器是在 :pep:`318` 中引進的。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1510
msgid "Multiple inheritance"
msgstr "多重繼承"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1512
msgid ""
"Python classes may have multiple base classes, a technique known as "
"*multiple inheritance*.  The base classes are specified in the class "
"definition by listing them in parentheses after the class name, separated by "
"commas. For example, the following class definition:"
msgstr ""
"Python 類別可以有多個基底類別，這種技術稱為\\ *多重繼承*。基底類別在類別定義"
"中指定，方式是將它們列在類別名稱後的括號內，並以逗號分隔。例如以下的類別定"
"義："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1517
msgid ""
">>> class A: pass\n"
">>> class B: pass\n"
">>> class C(A, B): pass"
msgstr ""
">>> class A: pass\n"
">>> class B: pass\n"
">>> class C(A, B): pass"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1523
msgid "defines a class ``C`` that inherits from classes ``A`` and ``B``."
msgstr "定義了一個繼承自類別 ``A`` 和 ``B`` 的類別 ``C``。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1525
msgid ""
"The :term:`method resolution order` (MRO) is the order in which base classes "
"are searched when looking up an attribute on a class. "
"See :ref:`python_2.3_mro` for a description of how Python determines the MRO "
"for a class."
msgstr ""
":term:`方法解析順序 <method resolution order>` (MRO) 是在類別上查找屬性時搜尋"
"基底類別的順序。關於 Python 如何決定類別的 MRO，請參"
"閱 :ref:`python_2.3_mro`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1529
msgid ""
"Multiple inheritance is not always allowed. Attempting to define a class "
"with multiple inheritance will raise an error if one of the bases does not "
"allow subclassing, if a consistent MRO cannot be created, if no valid "
"metaclass can be determined, or if there is an instance layout conflict. "
"We'll discuss each of these in turn."
msgstr ""
"多重繼承並非總是被允許。嘗試定義具有多重繼承的類別時，如果其中一個基底類別不"
"允許子類別化、無法建立一致的 MRO、無法決定有效的元類別，或是發生實例佈局 "
"(instance layout) 衝突，就會引發錯誤。以下會依序說明每一種情況。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1534
msgid ""
"First, all base classes must allow subclassing. While most classes allow "
"subclassing, some built-in classes do not, such as :class:`bool`:"
msgstr ""
"首先，所有基底類別都必須允許子類別化。雖然大多數類別都允許子類別化，但有些內"
"建類別不允許，例如 :class:`bool`："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1537
msgid ""
">>> class SubBool(bool):  # TypeError\n"
"...    pass\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"   ...\n"
"TypeError: type 'bool' is not an acceptable base type"
msgstr ""
">>> class SubBool(bool):  # TypeError\n"
"...    pass\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"   ...\n"
"TypeError: type 'bool' is not an acceptable base type"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1545
msgid ""
"In the resolved MRO of a class, the class's bases appear in the order they "
"were specified in the class's bases list. Additionally, the MRO always lists "
"a child class before any of its bases. A class definition will fail if it is "
"impossible to resolve a consistent MRO that satisfies these rules from the "
"list of bases provided:"
msgstr ""
"在類別解析後的 MRO 中，類別的各個基底類別會依照它們在該類別的基底類別串列中被"
"指定的順序出現。此外，MRO 一定會將子類別列在它的任何基底類別之前。如果無法從"
"所提供的基底類別串列中解析出滿足這些規則的一致 MRO，類別定義就會失敗："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1550
msgid ""
">>> class Base: pass\n"
">>> class Child(Base): pass\n"
">>> class Grandchild(Base, Child): pass  # TypeError\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"   ...\n"
"TypeError: Cannot create a consistent method resolution order (MRO) for "
"bases Base, Child"
msgstr ""
">>> class Base: pass\n"
">>> class Child(Base): pass\n"
">>> class Grandchild(Base, Child): pass  # TypeError\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"   ...\n"
"TypeError: Cannot create a consistent method resolution order (MRO) for "
"bases Base, Child"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1559
msgid ""
"In the MRO of ``Grandchild``, ``Base`` must appear before ``Child`` because "
"it is first in the base class list, but it must also appear after ``Child`` "
"because it is a parent of ``Child``. This is a contradiction, so the class "
"cannot be defined."
msgstr ""
"在 ``Grandchild`` 的 MRO 中，``Base`` 必須出現在 ``Child`` 之前，因為它在基底"
"類別串列中排在第一個；但它也必須出現在 ``Child`` 之後，因為它是 ``Child`` 的"
"父類別。這是矛盾的，因此無法定義該類別。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1563
msgid ""
"If some of the bases have a custom :term:`metaclass`, the metaclass of the "
"resulting class is chosen among the metaclasses of the bases and the "
"explicitly specified metaclass of the child class. It must be a metaclass "
"that is a subclass of all other candidate metaclasses. If no such metaclass "
"exists among the candidates, the class cannot be created, as explained "
"in :ref:`metaclass-determination`."
msgstr ""
"如果某些基底類別具有自訂的\\ :term:`元類別 <metaclass>`，所產生類別的元類別會"
"從各基底類別的元類別，以及子類別明確指定的元類別之中選出。它必須是所有其他候"
"選元類別的子類別。如果候選者中不存在這樣的元類別，就無法建立該類別，如"
"\\ :ref:`metaclass-determination`\\ 中所述。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1569
msgid ""
"Finally, the instance layouts of the bases must be compatible. This means "
"that it must be possible to compute a *solid base* for the class. Exactly "
"which classes are solid bases depends on the Python implementation."
msgstr ""
"最後，各基底類別的實例佈局必須相容。這表示必須能為該類別計算出一個 *solid "
"base*。究竟哪些類別是 solid base 取決於 Python 的實作。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1575
msgid ""
"In CPython, a class is a solid base if it has a "
"nonempty :attr:`~object.__slots__` definition. Many but not all classes "
"defined in C are also solid bases, including most builtins (such "
"as :class:`int` or :class:`BaseException`) but excluding most "
"concrete :class:`Exception` classes. Generally, a C class is a solid base if "
"its underlying struct is different in size from its base class."
msgstr ""
"在 CPython 中，如果一個類別有非空的 :attr:`~object.__slots__` 定義，它就是 "
"solid base。許多（但並非全部）以 C 定義的類別也是 solid base，包括大多數內建"
"類別（例如 :class:`int` 或 :class:`BaseException`），但不包括大多數具體"
"的 :class:`Exception` 類別。一般來說，如果一個 C 類別底層結構 (struct) 的大小"
"與其基底類別不同，它就是 solid base。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1582
msgid ""
"Every class has a solid base. :class:`object`, the base class, has itself as "
"its solid base. If there is a single base, the child class's solid base is "
"that class if it is a solid base, or else the base class's solid base. If "
"there are multiple bases, we first find the solid base for each base class "
"to produce a list of candidate solid bases. If there is a unique solid base "
"that is a subclass of all others, then that class is the solid base. "
"Otherwise, class creation fails."
msgstr ""
"每個類別都有一個 solid base。基底類別 :class:`object` 本身就是自己的 solid "
"base。如果只有一個基底類別，則當子類別本身是 solid base 時，它的 solid base "
"就是它自己；否則就是該基底類別的 solid base。如果有多個基底類別，會先找出每個"
"基底類別的 solid base，產生一個候選 solid base 的串列。如果其中有唯一一個 "
"solid base 是其他所有候選者的子類別，該類別就是 solid base；否則類別建立會失"
"敗。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1589
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "範例："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1591
msgid ""
">>> class Solid1:\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid1\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class Solid2:\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid2\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class SolidChild(Solid1):\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid_child\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class C1:  # solid base is `object`\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # OK: solid bases are `Solid1` and `object`, and `Solid1` is a subclass "
"of `object`.\n"
">>> class C2(Solid1, C1):  # solid base is `Solid1`\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # OK: solid bases are `SolidChild` and `Solid1`, and `SolidChild` is a "
"subclass of `Solid1`.\n"
">>> class C3(SolidChild, Solid1):  # solid base is `SolidChild`\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # Error: solid bases are `Solid1` and `Solid2`, but neither is a "
"subclass of the other.\n"
">>> class C4(Solid1, Solid2):  # error: no single solid base\n"
"...    pass\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"  ...\n"
"TypeError: multiple bases have instance lay-out conflict"
msgstr ""
">>> class Solid1:\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid1\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class Solid2:\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid2\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class SolidChild(Solid1):\n"
"...    __slots__ = (\"solid_child\",)\n"
">>>\n"
">>> class C1:  # solid base 是 object\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # OK：solid base 分別是 Solid1 和 object，且 Solid1 是 object 的子類"
"別。\n"
">>> class C2(Solid1, C1):  # solid base 是 Solid1\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # OK：solid base 分別是 SolidChild 和 Solid1，且 SolidChild 是 Solid1 的"
"子類別。\n"
">>> class C3(SolidChild, Solid1):  # solid base 是 SolidChild\n"
"...    pass\n"
">>>\n"
">>> # 錯誤：solid base 分別是 Solid1 和 Solid2，但兩者都不是對方的子類別。\n"
">>> class C4(Solid1, Solid2):  # 錯誤：沒有單一的 solid base\n"
"...    pass\n"
"Traceback (most recent call last):\n"
"  ...\n"
"TypeError: multiple bases have instance lay-out conflict"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1623
msgid "Coroutines"
msgstr "協程"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1631
msgid "Coroutine function definition"
msgstr "協程函式定義"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1641
msgid ""
"Execution of Python coroutines can be suspended and resumed at many points "
"(see :term:`coroutine`). :keyword:`await` expressions, :keyword:`async for` "
"and :keyword:`async with` can only be used in the body of a coroutine "
"function."
msgstr ""
"Python 協程的執行可以在許多時間點被暫停和恢復（請參閱\\ :term:`協程 "
"<coroutine>`）。:keyword:`await` 運算式、:keyword:`async for` "
"和 :keyword:`async with` 只能在協程函式的主體中使用。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1645
msgid ""
"Functions defined with ``async def`` syntax are always coroutine functions, "
"even if they do not contain ``await`` or ``async`` keywords."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``async def`` 語法定義的函式一律是協程函式，即使它們不包含 ``await`` 或 "
"``async`` 關鍵字也一樣。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1648
msgid ""
"It is a :exc:`SyntaxError` to use a ``yield from`` expression inside the "
"body of a coroutine function."
msgstr ""
"在協程函式的主體內使用 ``yield from`` 運算式會導致 :exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1651
msgid "An example of a coroutine function::"
msgstr "一個協程函式範例： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1653
msgid ""
"async def func(param1, param2):\n"
"    do_stuff()\n"
"    await some_coroutine()"
msgstr ""
"async def func(param1, param2):\n"
"    do_stuff()\n"
"    await some_coroutine()"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1657
msgid ""
"``await`` and ``async`` are now keywords; previously they were only treated "
"as such inside the body of a coroutine function."
msgstr ""
"``await`` 和 ``async`` 現在是關鍵字；先前它們只有在協程函式的主體內才被視為關"
"鍵字。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1665
msgid "The :keyword:`!async for` statement"
msgstr ":keyword:`!async for` 陳述式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1670
msgid ""
"An :term:`asynchronous iterable` provides an ``__aiter__`` method that "
"directly returns an :term:`asynchronous iterator`, which can call "
"asynchronous code in its ``__anext__`` method."
msgstr ""
":term:`非同步可疊代物件 <asynchronous iterable>`\\ 提供一個 ``__aiter__`` 方"
"法，該方法會直接回傳一個\\ :term:`非同步疊代器 <asynchronous iterator>`，而該"
"疊代器可以在其 ``__anext__`` 方法中呼叫非同步程式碼。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1674
msgid ""
"The ``async for`` statement allows convenient iteration over asynchronous "
"iterables."
msgstr "``async for`` 陳述式可以方便地對非同步可疊代物件進行疊代。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1679
msgid ""
"async for TARGET in ITER:\n"
"    SUITE\n"
"else:\n"
"    SUITE2"
msgstr ""
"async for TARGET in ITER:\n"
"    SUITE\n"
"else:\n"
"    SUITE2"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1684
msgid "Is semantically equivalent to::"
msgstr "在語義上等同於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1686
msgid ""
"iter = (ITER).__aiter__()\n"
"running = True\n"
"\n"
"while running:\n"
"    try:\n"
"        TARGET = await iter.__anext__()\n"
"    except StopAsyncIteration:\n"
"        running = False\n"
"    else:\n"
"        SUITE\n"
"else:\n"
"    SUITE2"
msgstr ""
"iter = (ITER).__aiter__()\n"
"running = True\n"
"\n"
"while running:\n"
"    try:\n"
"        TARGET = await iter.__anext__()\n"
"    except StopAsyncIteration:\n"
"        running = False\n"
"    else:\n"
"        SUITE\n"
"else:\n"
"    SUITE2"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1699
msgid ""
"except that implicit :ref:`special method lookup <special-lookup>` is used "
"for :meth:`~object.__aiter__` and :meth:`~object.__anext__`."
msgstr ""
"不同之處在於 :meth:`~object.__aiter__` 和 :meth:`~object.__anext__` 使用的是"
"隱式的\\ :ref:`特殊方法查找 <special-lookup>`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1702
msgid ""
"It is a :exc:`SyntaxError` to use an ``async for`` statement outside the "
"body of a coroutine function."
msgstr ""
"在協程函式的主體之外使用 ``async for`` 陳述式會導致 :exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1710
msgid "The :keyword:`!async with` statement"
msgstr ":keyword:`!async with` 陳述式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1715
msgid ""
"An :term:`asynchronous context manager` is a :term:`context manager` that is "
"able to suspend execution in its *enter* and *exit* methods."
msgstr ""
":term:`非同步情境管理器 <asynchronous context manager>`\\ 是一種能夠在其 "
"*enter* 和 *exit* 方法中暫停執行的\\ :term:`情境管理器 <context manager>`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1720
msgid ""
"async with EXPRESSION as TARGET:\n"
"    SUITE"
msgstr ""
"async with EXPRESSION as TARGET:\n"
"    SUITE"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1725
msgid ""
"manager = (EXPRESSION)\n"
"aenter = manager.__aenter__\n"
"aexit = manager.__aexit__\n"
"value = await aenter()\n"
"hit_except = False\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    TARGET = value\n"
"    SUITE\n"
"except:\n"
"    hit_except = True\n"
"    if not await aexit(*sys.exc_info()):\n"
"        raise\n"
"finally:\n"
"    if not hit_except:\n"
"        await aexit(None, None, None)"
msgstr ""
"manager = (EXPRESSION)\n"
"aenter = manager.__aenter__\n"
"aexit = manager.__aexit__\n"
"value = await aenter()\n"
"hit_except = False\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    TARGET = value\n"
"    SUITE\n"
"except:\n"
"    hit_except = True\n"
"    if not await aexit(*sys.exc_info()):\n"
"        raise\n"
"finally:\n"
"    if not hit_except:\n"
"        await aexit(None, None, None)"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1742
msgid ""
"except that implicit :ref:`special method lookup <special-lookup>` is used "
"for :meth:`~object.__aenter__` and :meth:`~object.__aexit__`."
msgstr ""
"不同之處在於 :meth:`~object.__aenter__` 和 :meth:`~object.__aexit__` 使用的是"
"隱式的\\ :ref:`特殊方法查找 <special-lookup>`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1745
msgid ""
"It is a :exc:`SyntaxError` to use an ``async with`` statement outside the "
"body of a coroutine function."
msgstr ""
"在協程函式的主體之外使用 ``async with`` 陳述式會導致 :exc:`SyntaxError`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1750
msgid ":pep:`492` - Coroutines with async and await syntax"
msgstr ":pep:`492` - 使用 async 和 await 語法的協程"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1751
msgid ""
"The proposal that made coroutines a proper standalone concept in Python, and "
"added supporting syntax."
msgstr "使協程成為 Python 中一個真正獨立的概念，並新增支援語法的提案。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1757
msgid "Type parameter lists"
msgstr "型別參數列表"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1761
msgid "Support for default values was added (see :pep:`696`)."
msgstr "新增對預設值的支援（請參閱 :pep:`696`）。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1774
msgid ""
":ref:`Functions <def>` (including :ref:`coroutines <async "
"def>`), :ref:`classes <class>` and :ref:`type aliases <type>` may contain a "
"type parameter list::"
msgstr ""
":ref:`函式 <def>`\\ （包括\\ :ref:`協程 <async def>`）、:ref:`類別 "
"<class>`\\ 和\\ :ref:`型別別名 <type>`\\ 可以包含型別參數列表： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1778
msgid ""
"def max[T](args: list[T]) -> T:\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"async def amax[T](args: list[T]) -> T:\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"class Bag[T]:\n"
"    def __iter__(self) -> Iterator[T]:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"    def add(self, arg: T) -> None:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"type ListOrSet[T] = list[T] | set[T]"
msgstr ""
"def max[T](args: list[T]) -> T:\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"async def amax[T](args: list[T]) -> T:\n"
"    ...\n"
"\n"
"class Bag[T]:\n"
"    def __iter__(self) -> Iterator[T]:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"    def add(self, arg: T) -> None:\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"type ListOrSet[T] = list[T] | set[T]"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1793
msgid ""
"Semantically, this indicates that the function, class, or type alias is "
"generic over a type variable. This information is primarily used by static "
"type checkers, and at runtime, generic objects behave much like their non-"
"generic counterparts."
msgstr ""
"在語義上，這表示該函式、類別或型別別名是基於某個型別變數的泛型。此資訊主要供"
"靜態型別檢查器使用；在 runtime，泛型物件的行為與其非泛型的對應物件大致相同。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1798
msgid ""
"Type parameters are declared in square brackets (``[]``) immediately after "
"the name of the function, class, or type alias. The type parameters are "
"accessible within the scope of the generic object, but not elsewhere. Thus, "
"after a declaration ``def func[T](): pass``, the name ``T`` is not available "
"in the module scope. Below, the semantics of generic objects are described "
"with more precision. The scope of type parameters is modeled with a special "
"function (technically, an :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-scopes>`) that "
"wraps the creation of the generic object."
msgstr ""
"型別參數宣告於函式、類別或型別別名名稱之後緊接的方括號 (``[]``) 中。型別參數"
"可以在泛型物件的作用域中存取，但不能在其他地方存取。因此，在宣告 ``def "
"func[T](): pass`` 之後，名稱 ``T`` 在模組作用域中是無法使用的。以下會更精確地"
"描述泛型物件的語義。型別參數的作用域是以一個特殊函式（技術上來說是一個"
"\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 <annotation-scopes>`）來建模的，該函式包裝了泛型物件的建"
"立。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1807
msgid ""
"Generic functions, classes, and type aliases have "
"a :attr:`~definition.__type_params__` attribute listing their type "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"泛型函式、類別和型別別名有一個 :attr:`~definition.__type_params__` 屬性，列出"
"它們的型別參數。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1810
msgid "Type parameters come in three kinds:"
msgstr "型別參數有三種："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1812
msgid ""
":data:`typing.TypeVar`, introduced by a plain name (e.g., ``T``). "
"Semantically, this represents a single type to a type checker."
msgstr ""
":data:`typing.TypeVar`，以一般名稱宣告（例如 ``T``）。在語義上，這對型別檢查"
"器而言代表單一型別。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1814
msgid ""
":data:`typing.TypeVarTuple`, introduced by a name prefixed with a single "
"asterisk (e.g., ``*Ts``). Semantically, this stands for a tuple of any "
"number of types."
msgstr ""
":data:`typing.TypeVarTuple`，以帶有單一星號前綴的名稱宣告（例如 ``*Ts``）。在"
"語義上，這代表由任意數量型別組成的元組。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1817
msgid ""
":data:`typing.ParamSpec`, introduced by a name prefixed with two asterisks "
"(e.g., ``**P``). Semantically, this stands for the parameters of a callable."
msgstr ""
":data:`typing.ParamSpec`，以帶有兩個星號前綴的名稱宣告（例如 ``**P``）。在語"
"義上，這代表可呼叫物件的參數。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1820
msgid ""
":data:`typing.TypeVar` declarations can define *bounds* and *constraints* "
"with a colon (``:``) followed by an expression. A single expression after "
"the colon indicates a bound (e.g. ``T: int``). Semantically, this means that "
"the :data:`!typing.TypeVar` can only represent types that are a subtype of "
"this bound. A parenthesized tuple of expressions after the colon indicates a "
"set of constraints (e.g. ``T: (str, bytes)``). Each member of the tuple "
"should be a type (again, this is not enforced at runtime). Constrained type "
"variables can only take on one of the types in the list of constraints."
msgstr ""
":data:`typing.TypeVar` 宣告可以使用冒號 (``:``) 後接一個運算式來定義\\ *邊界 "
"(bounds)*\\ 和\\ *限制 (constraints)*。冒號之後的單一運算式表示邊界（例如 "
"``T: int``）。在語義上，這表示該 :data:`!typing.TypeVar` 只能代表屬於此邊界之"
"子型別的型別。冒號之後以圓括號括起來的運算式元組則表示一組限制（例如 ``T: "
"(str, bytes)``）。元組的每個成員都應該是一個型別（同樣地，這在 runtime 不會被"
"強制執行）。受限制的型別變數只能是限制串列中的其中一個型別。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1829
msgid ""
"For :data:`!typing.TypeVar`\\ s declared using the type parameter list "
"syntax, the bound and constraints are not evaluated when the generic object "
"is created, but only when the value is explicitly accessed through the "
"attributes ``__bound__`` and ``__constraints__``. To accomplish this, the "
"bounds or constraints are evaluated in a separate :ref:`annotation scope "
"<annotation-scopes>`."
msgstr ""
"對於使用型別參數列表語法宣告的 :data:`!typing.TypeVar`，其邊界和限制不會在建"
"立泛型物件時求值，而是只有在透過 ``__bound__`` 和 ``__constraints__`` 屬性明"
"確存取該值時才會求值。為此，邊界或限制會在一個獨立的\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 "
"<annotation-scopes>`\\ 中求值。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1835
msgid ""
":data:`typing.TypeVarTuple`\\ s and :data:`typing.ParamSpec`\\ s cannot have "
"bounds or constraints."
msgstr ""
":data:`typing.TypeVarTuple` 和 :data:`typing.ParamSpec` 不能有邊界或限制。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1838
msgid ""
"All three flavors of type parameters can also have a *default value*, which "
"is used when the type parameter is not explicitly provided. This is added by "
"appending a single equals sign (``=``) followed by an expression. Like the "
"bounds and constraints of type variables, the default value is not evaluated "
"when the object is created, but only when the type parameter's "
"``__default__`` attribute is accessed. To this end, the default value is "
"evaluated in a separate :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-scopes>`. If no "
"default value is specified for a type parameter, the ``__default__`` "
"attribute is set to the special sentinel object :data:`typing.NoDefault`."
msgstr ""
"三種型別參數都可以有一個\\ *預設值*，在未明確提供該型別參數時使用。預設值是透"
"過附加一個等號 (``=``) 後接一個運算式來加入的。就像型別變數的邊界和限制一樣，"
"預設值不會在建立物件時求值，而是只有在存取該型別參數的 ``__default__`` 屬性時"
"才會求值。為此，預設值會在一個獨立的\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 <annotation-"
"scopes>`\\ 中求值。如果沒有為型別參數指定預設值，則 ``__default__`` 屬性會被"
"設為特殊的哨兵物件 :data:`typing.NoDefault`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1848
msgid ""
"The following example indicates the full set of allowed type parameter "
"declarations::"
msgstr "以下範例展示了所有允許的型別參數宣告形式： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1850
msgid ""
"def overly_generic[\n"
"   SimpleTypeVar,\n"
"   TypeVarWithBound: int,\n"
"   TypeVarWithConstraints: (str, bytes),\n"
"   TypeVarWithDefault = int,\n"
"   *SimpleTypeVarTuple = (int, float),\n"
"   **SimpleParamSpec = (str, bytearray),\n"
"](\n"
"   a: SimpleTypeVar,\n"
"   b: TypeVarWithDefault,\n"
"   c: TypeVarWithBound,\n"
"   d: Callable[SimpleParamSpec, TypeVarWithConstraints],\n"
"   *e: SimpleTypeVarTuple,\n"
"): ..."
msgstr ""
"def overly_generic[\n"
"   SimpleTypeVar,\n"
"   TypeVarWithBound: int,\n"
"   TypeVarWithConstraints: (str, bytes),\n"
"   TypeVarWithDefault = int,\n"
"   *SimpleTypeVarTuple = (int, float),\n"
"   **SimpleParamSpec = (str, bytearray),\n"
"](\n"
"   a: SimpleTypeVar,\n"
"   b: TypeVarWithDefault,\n"
"   c: TypeVarWithBound,\n"
"   d: Callable[SimpleParamSpec, TypeVarWithConstraints],\n"
"   *e: SimpleTypeVarTuple,\n"
"): ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1868
msgid "Generic functions"
msgstr "泛型函式"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1870
msgid "Generic functions are declared as follows::"
msgstr "泛型函式的宣告方式如下： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1872
msgid "def func[T](arg: T): ..."
msgstr "def func[T](arg: T): ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1874
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1934
msgid "This syntax is equivalent to::"
msgstr "此語法等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1876
msgid ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    def func(arg: T): ...\n"
"    func.__type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"    return func\n"
"func = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func()"
msgstr ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    def func(arg: T): ...\n"
"    func.__type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"    return func\n"
"func = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func()"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1883
msgid ""
"Here ``annotation-def`` indicates an :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-"
"scopes>`, which is not actually bound to any name at runtime. (One other "
"liberty is taken in the translation: the syntax does not go through "
"attribute access on the :mod:`typing` module, but creates an instance "
"of :data:`typing.TypeVar` directly.)"
msgstr ""
"這裡的 ``annotation-def`` 表示一個\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 <annotation-scopes>`，"
"它在 runtime 實際上不會被繫結到任何名稱。（這段轉譯還另外做了一點變通：該語法"
"並不會透過 :mod:`typing` 模組的屬性存取，而是直接建立 :data:`typing.TypeVar` "
"的實例。）"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1889
msgid ""
"The annotations of generic functions are evaluated within the annotation "
"scope used for declaring the type parameters, but the function's defaults "
"and decorators are not."
msgstr ""
"泛型函式的註釋會在用於宣告型別參數的註釋作用域內求值，但函式的預設值和裝飾器"
"則不會。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1893
msgid ""
"The following example illustrates the scoping rules for these cases, as well "
"as for additional flavors of type parameters::"
msgstr ""
"以下範例說明了這些情況下的作用域規則，以及其他種類的型別參數的作用域規則： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1896
msgid ""
"@decorator\n"
"def func[T: int, *Ts, **P](*args: *Ts, arg: Callable[P, T] = some_default):\n"
"    ..."
msgstr ""
"@decorator\n"
"def func[T: int, *Ts, **P](*args: *Ts, arg: Callable[P, T] = some_default):\n"
"    ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1900
msgid ""
"Except for the :ref:`lazy evaluation <lazy-evaluation>` of "
"the :class:`~typing.TypeVar` bound, this is equivalent to::"
msgstr ""
"除了 :class:`~typing.TypeVar` 邊界的\\ :ref:`惰性求值 (lazy evaluation) "
"<lazy-evaluation>`\\ 之外，這等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1903
msgid ""
"DEFAULT_OF_arg = some_default\n"
"\n"
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func():\n"
"\n"
"    annotation-def BOUND_OF_T():\n"
"        return int\n"
"    # In reality, BOUND_OF_T() is evaluated only on demand.\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\", bound=BOUND_OF_T())\n"
"\n"
"    Ts = typing.TypeVarTuple(\"Ts\")\n"
"    P = typing.ParamSpec(\"P\")\n"
"\n"
"    def func(*args: *Ts, arg: Callable[P, T] = DEFAULT_OF_arg):\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"    func.__type_params__ = (T, Ts, P)\n"
"    return func\n"
"func = decorator(TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func())"
msgstr ""
"DEFAULT_OF_arg = some_default\n"
"\n"
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func():\n"
"\n"
"    annotation-def BOUND_OF_T():\n"
"        return int\n"
"    # 實際上，BOUND_OF_T() 只會在需要時才求值。\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\", bound=BOUND_OF_T())\n"
"\n"
"    Ts = typing.TypeVarTuple(\"Ts\")\n"
"    P = typing.ParamSpec(\"P\")\n"
"\n"
"    def func(*args: *Ts, arg: Callable[P, T] = DEFAULT_OF_arg):\n"
"        ...\n"
"\n"
"    func.__type_params__ = (T, Ts, P)\n"
"    return func\n"
"func = decorator(TYPE_PARAMS_OF_func())"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1922
msgid ""
"The capitalized names like ``DEFAULT_OF_arg`` are not actually bound at "
"runtime."
msgstr "像 ``DEFAULT_OF_arg`` 這種大寫名稱在 runtime 實際上並不會被繫結。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1928
msgid "Generic classes"
msgstr "泛型類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1930
msgid "Generic classes are declared as follows::"
msgstr "泛型類別的宣告方式如下： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1932
msgid "class Bag[T]: ..."
msgstr "class Bag[T]: ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1936
msgid ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    class Bag(typing.Generic[T]):\n"
"        __type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"        ...\n"
"    return Bag\n"
"Bag = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag()"
msgstr ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    class Bag(typing.Generic[T]):\n"
"        __type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"        ...\n"
"    return Bag\n"
"Bag = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag()"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1944
msgid ""
"Here again ``annotation-def`` (not a real keyword) indicates "
"an :ref:`annotation scope <annotation-scopes>`, and the name "
"``TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag`` is not actually bound at runtime."
msgstr ""
"這裡同樣以 ``annotation-def``\\ （並非真正的關鍵字）表示一個\\ :ref:`註釋作用"
"域 <annotation-scopes>`，而名稱 ``TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag`` 在 runtime 實際上並不"
"會被繫結。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1948
msgid ""
"Generic classes implicitly inherit from :data:`typing.Generic`. The base "
"classes and keyword arguments of generic classes are evaluated within the "
"type scope for the type parameters, and decorators are evaluated outside "
"that scope. This is illustrated by this example::"
msgstr ""
"泛型類別會隱式地繼承自 :data:`typing.Generic`。泛型類別的基底類別和關鍵字引數"
"會在型別參數的型別作用域內求值，而裝飾器則在該作用域之外求值。以下範例說明了"
"這一點： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1954
msgid ""
"@decorator\n"
"class Bag[T](Base[T], arg=T): ..."
msgstr ""
"@decorator\n"
"class Bag[T](Base[T], arg=T): ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1957
msgid "This is equivalent to::"
msgstr "這等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1959
msgid ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    class Bag(Base[T], typing.Generic[T], arg=T):\n"
"        __type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"        ...\n"
"    return Bag\n"
"Bag = decorator(TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag())"
msgstr ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"    class Bag(Base[T], typing.Generic[T], arg=T):\n"
"        __type_params__ = (T,)\n"
"        ...\n"
"    return Bag\n"
"Bag = decorator(TYPE_PARAMS_OF_Bag())"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1970
msgid "Generic type aliases"
msgstr "泛型型別別名"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1972
msgid ""
"The :keyword:`type` statement can also be used to create a generic type "
"alias::"
msgstr ":keyword:`type` 陳述式也可以用來建立泛型型別別名： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1974
msgid "type ListOrSet[T] = list[T] | set[T]"
msgstr "type ListOrSet[T] = list[T] | set[T]"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1976
msgid ""
"Except for the :ref:`lazy evaluation <lazy-evaluation>` of the value, this "
"is equivalent to::"
msgstr "除了值的\\ :ref:`惰性求值 <lazy-evaluation>`\\ 之外，這等價於： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1979
msgid ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"\n"
"    annotation-def VALUE_OF_ListOrSet():\n"
"        return list[T] | set[T]\n"
"    # In reality, the value is lazily evaluated\n"
"    return typing.TypeAliasType(\"ListOrSet\", VALUE_OF_ListOrSet(), "
"type_params=(T,))\n"
"ListOrSet = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet()"
msgstr ""
"annotation-def TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet():\n"
"    T = typing.TypeVar(\"T\")\n"
"\n"
"    annotation-def VALUE_OF_ListOrSet():\n"
"        return list[T] | set[T]\n"
"    # 實際上，該值是惰性求值的\n"
"    return typing.TypeAliasType(\"ListOrSet\", VALUE_OF_ListOrSet(), "
"type_params=(T,))\n"
"ListOrSet = TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet()"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1988
msgid ""
"Here, ``annotation-def`` (not a real keyword) indicates an :ref:`annotation "
"scope <annotation-scopes>`. The capitalized names like "
"``TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet`` are not actually bound at runtime."
msgstr ""
"這裡的 ``annotation-def``\\ （並非真正的關鍵字）表示一個\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 "
"<annotation-scopes>`。像 ``TYPE_PARAMS_OF_ListOrSet`` 這種大寫名稱在 runtime "
"實際上並不會被繫結。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1995
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr "註釋"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:1997
msgid "Annotations are now lazily evaluated by default."
msgstr "註釋現在預設為惰性求值。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2000
msgid ""
"Variables and function parameters may carry :term:`annotations "
"<annotation>`, created by adding a colon after the name, followed by an "
"expression::"
msgstr ""
"變數和函式參數可以帶有\\ :term:`註釋 <annotation>`，其建立方式是在名稱後面加"
"上冒號，再接著一個運算式： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2003
msgid ""
"x: annotation = 1\n"
"def f(param: annotation): ..."
msgstr ""
"x: annotation = 1\n"
"def f(param: annotation): ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2006
msgid "Functions may also carry a return annotation following an arrow::"
msgstr "函式也可以在箭頭之後帶有回傳註釋： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2008
msgid "def f() -> annotation: ..."
msgstr "def f() -> annotation: ..."

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2010
msgid ""
"Annotations are conventionally used for :term:`type hints <type hint>`, but "
"this is not enforced by the language, and in general annotations may contain "
"arbitrary expressions. The presence of annotations does not change the "
"runtime semantics of the code, except if some mechanism is used that "
"introspects and uses the annotations (such as :mod:`dataclasses` "
"or :deco:`functools.singledispatch`)."
msgstr ""
"註釋慣例上用於\\ :term:`型別提示 <type hint>`，但語言本身並不強制這一點，一般"
"而言註釋可以包含任意運算式。註釋的存在不會改變程式碼在 runtime 的語義，除非使"
"用了某種會內省並使用註釋的機制（例如 :mod:`dataclasses` "
"或 :deco:`functools.singledispatch`）。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2016
msgid ""
"By default, annotations are lazily evaluated in an :ref:`annotation scope "
"<annotation-scopes>`. This means that they are not evaluated when the code "
"containing the annotation is evaluated. Instead, the interpreter saves "
"information that can be used to evaluate the annotation later if requested. "
"The :mod:`annotationlib` module provides tools for evaluating annotations."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，註釋會在\\ :ref:`註釋作用域 <annotation-scopes>`\\ 中惰性求值。這"
"表示當包含註釋的程式碼被求值時，註釋並不會被求值。相反地，直譯器會保存一些資"
"訊，以便之後在需要時用來對註釋求值。:mod:`annotationlib` 模組提供了對註釋求值"
"的工具。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2021
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`future statement <future>` ``from __future__ import "
"annotations`` is present, all annotations are instead stored as strings::"
msgstr ""
"如果存在\\ :ref:`future 陳述式 <future>` ``from __future__ import "
"annotations``，則所有註釋都會改為以字串形式儲存： ::"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2024
msgid ""
">>> from __future__ import annotations\n"
">>> def f(param: annotation): ...\n"
">>> f.__annotations__\n"
"{'param': 'annotation'}"
msgstr ""
">>> from __future__ import annotations\n"
">>> def f(param: annotation): ...\n"
">>> f.__annotations__\n"
"{'param': 'annotation'}"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2029
msgid ""
"This future statement will be deprecated and removed in a future version of "
"Python, but not before Python 3.13 reaches its end of life (see :pep:`749`). "
"When it is used, introspection tools "
"like :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` and :func:`typing.get_type_hints` "
"are less likely to be able to resolve annotations at runtime."
msgstr ""
"此 future 陳述式將在未來的 Python 版本中被棄用並移除，但時間不會早於 Python "
"3.13 生命週期結束之時（請參閱 :pep:`749`）。使用它時，"
"像 :func:`annotationlib.get_annotations` 和 :func:`typing.get_type_hints` 這"
"類內省工具較不容易在 runtime 解析註釋。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2037
msgid "Footnotes"
msgstr "註解"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2038
msgid ""
"The exception is propagated to the invocation stack unless there is "
"a :keyword:`finally` clause which happens to raise another exception. That "
"new exception causes the old one to be lost."
msgstr ""
"除非有一個 :keyword:`finally` 子句剛好引發了另一個例外，否則該例外會被傳播到"
"呼叫堆疊。這個新的例外會導致舊的例外遺失。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2042
msgid "In pattern matching, a sequence is defined as one of the following:"
msgstr "在模式匹配中，序列被定義為以下其中之一："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2044
msgid "a class that inherits from :class:`collections.abc.Sequence`"
msgstr "繼承自 :class:`collections.abc.Sequence` 的類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2045
msgid ""
"a Python class that has been registered as :class:`collections.abc.Sequence`"
msgstr "已註冊為 :class:`collections.abc.Sequence` 的 Python 類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2046
msgid ""
"a builtin class that has its (CPython) :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` bit set"
msgstr "設定了其 (CPython) :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_SEQUENCE` 位元的內建類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2047
#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2066
msgid "a class that inherits from any of the above"
msgstr "繼承自上述任何一種的類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2049
msgid "The following standard library classes are sequences:"
msgstr "以下標準函式庫類別是序列："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2051
msgid ":class:`array.array`"
msgstr ":class:`array.array`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2052
msgid ":class:`collections.deque`"
msgstr ":class:`collections.deque`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2054
msgid ":class:`memoryview`"
msgstr ":class:`memoryview`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2055
msgid ":class:`range`"
msgstr ":class:`range`"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2058
msgid ""
"Subject values of type ``str``, ``bytes``, and ``bytearray`` do not match "
"sequence patterns."
msgstr "型別為 ``str``、``bytes`` 和 ``bytearray`` 的主題值不會匹配序列模式。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2061
msgid "In pattern matching, a mapping is defined as one of the following:"
msgstr "在模式匹配中，對映被定義為以下其中之一："

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2063
msgid "a class that inherits from :class:`collections.abc.Mapping`"
msgstr "繼承自 :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` 的類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2064
msgid ""
"a Python class that has been registered as :class:`collections.abc.Mapping`"
msgstr "已註冊為 :class:`collections.abc.Mapping` 的 Python 類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2065
msgid ""
"a builtin class that has its (CPython) :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` bit set"
msgstr "設定了其 (CPython) :c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MAPPING` 位元的內建類別"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2068
msgid ""
"The standard library classes :class:`dict` "
"and :class:`types.MappingProxyType` are mappings."
msgstr ""
"標準函式庫類別 :class:`dict` 和 :class:`types.MappingProxyType` 是對映。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2071
msgid ""
"A string literal appearing as the first statement in the function body is "
"transformed into the function's :attr:`~function.__doc__` attribute and "
"therefore the function's :term:`docstring`."
msgstr ""
"作為函式主體中第一個陳述式出現的字串字面值，會被轉換為函式"
"的 :attr:`~function.__doc__` 屬性，也因此成為函式的\\ :term:`說明字串 "
"<docstring>`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:2075
msgid ""
"A string literal appearing as the first statement in the class body is "
"transformed into the namespace's :attr:`~type.__doc__` item and therefore "
"the class's :term:`docstring`."
msgstr ""
"作為類別主體中第一個陳述式出現的字串字面值，會被轉換為命名空間"
"的 :attr:`~type.__doc__` 項目，也因此成為類別的\\ :term:`說明字串 "
"<docstring>`。"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:7
msgid "compound"
msgstr "compound（複合）"

#: ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:7 ../../reference/compound_stmts.rst:86
